{const c={"id":"welllog-porosity-fusion-v2","sceneId":"w2","title":"储层参数智能解释：多曲线融合孔隙度","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-10-31","methods":["ts","opt"],"tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"测井仪器记录的是岩石的物理响应，并不直接测出“储层有多好”。本例选孔隙度作为一个可解释的小问题：当泥质把中子曲线抬高时，怎样结合自然伽马和密度，把 apparent response 变成可复核的孔隙度候选？","judge":[{"label":"数据形态","value":"多曲线序列","desc":"同一深度的 GR、DEN、CNL 必须配对"},{"label":"标注来源","value":"岩心 / 可靠解释","desc":"演示用合成真值，现场标签需深度归位"},{"label":"可见收益","value":"减轻泥质偏差","desc":"对照单 CNL 读数，展示偏差被校正的条件"},{"label":"难度","value":"中","desc":"跨井迁移、气层与井眼环境是主要卡点"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"PROBLEM","title":"当前做法与问题：把曲线读数当成孔隙度，会错在哪？","html":"<p><b>孔隙度</b>决定岩石可容纳流体的空间比例，是储层评价的基础，但不等于渗透率，更不直接代表含油量。解释员通常把密度、中子等曲线与岩心配对，结合岩性和井况进行校正。</p><figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图 1 · 先理解岩石中的空间，再理解测井响应。示意比例不用于物性计算。\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fbfaf6\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"25\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"33\" cy=\"25\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"25\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"59\" cy=\"25\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"25\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"25\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"98\" cy=\"25\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"111\" cy=\"25\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"124\" cy=\"25\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"137\" cy=\"25\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"48\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"33\" cy=\"48\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"48\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"59\" cy=\"48\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"48\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"48\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"98\" cy=\"48\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"111\" cy=\"48\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"124\" cy=\"48\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"137\" cy=\"48\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"71\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"33\" cy=\"71\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"71\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"59\" cy=\"71\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"71\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"71\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"98\" cy=\"71\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"111\" cy=\"71\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"124\" cy=\"71\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"137\" cy=\"71\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"94\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"33\" cy=\"94\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"94\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"59\" cy=\"94\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"94\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"94\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"98\" cy=\"94\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"111\" cy=\"94\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"124\" cy=\"94\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"137\" cy=\"94\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"117\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"33\" cy=\"117\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"117\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"59\" cy=\"117\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"117\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"117\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"98\" cy=\"117\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"111\" cy=\"117\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"124\" cy=\"117\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><circle cx=\"137\" cy=\"117\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"#d8c7a6\"/><g fill=\"#242b2e\" font-size=\"15\"><text x=\"185\" y=\"42\">孔隙度 φ = 孔隙体积 / 岩石总体积</text><text x=\"185\" y=\"78\">绿色：孔隙；米色：岩石颗粒（仅示意）</text><text x=\"185\" y=\"114\">储集空间 ≠ 连通能力；孔隙度不能替代渗透率</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a;margin-top:5px\">图 1 · 先理解岩石中的空间，再理解测井响应。示意比例不用于物性计算。</figcaption></figure><p>中子测井主要对含氢物质响应；泥质中的束缚水会让读数偏高。如果把 CNL 直接当孔隙度，泥质段可能看起来“孔隙很多”，实际却是<b>响应来源混淆</b>。密度响应、GR 提供的泥质线索可帮助区分，但井径扩径、气体和矿物变化也会带来多解。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"INTERVENTION","title":"AI 能做什么：学习多条曲线之间的校正关系","html":"<p>本例用<b>岭回归</b>学习 [GR, DEN, CNL] 到孔隙度的映射。先用训练集计算均值和标准差，再求解带 L2 惩罚的回归系数。新井只带入观测曲线计算，不读取真值，也不一边看测试答案一边训练。</p><figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图 2 · 模型替代多曲线经验组合中的部分映射，不替代地质解释与质控。\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fbfaf6\"/><g font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#242b2e\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"18\" width=\"155\" height=\"122\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"45\">GR：泥质响应线索</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"80\">DEN：体积密度</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"115\">CNL：含氢响应</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"78\">→</text><rect x=\"220\" y=\"38\" width=\"170\" height=\"80\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f1ece2\"/><text x=\"235\" y=\"68\">独立样本学习映射</text><text x=\"235\" y=\"94\">岭回归 / 标准化</text><text x=\"410\" y=\"78\">→</text><text x=\"445\" y=\"64\">孔隙度候选曲线</text><text x=\"445\" y=\"100\">岩心与井况复核</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a;margin-top:5px\">图 2 · 模型替代多曲线经验组合中的部分映射，不替代地质解释与质控。</figcaption></figure><p>它替代的是重复执行的<b>多曲线经验组合</b>，输出仍是候选。演示选择清晰的浅层模型，是为了能把某个深度的预测拆成截距和三个输入项，看到模型怎样修正 CNL 的泥质偏高；并未声称实现深度网络或通用储层解释。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"需要准备什么：标签、尺度与井间隔离","html":"<p><b>曲线：</b>同深度 GR（API）、DEN（g/cm³）、CNL（v/v），先检查缺失、单位、采样间隔与井径异常。<b>标签：</b>岩心孔隙度或经过复核的解释值，统一孔隙度定义并做深度归位；不能默认岩心总孔隙度与测井有效孔隙度完全等价。</p><figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图 3 · 独立划分的不是随机相邻像素，而是不同井的数据来源。\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fbfaf6\"/><g font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#242b2e\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"25\" width=\"285\" height=\"88\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"56\">训练：6 口合成井 × 75 点 = 450 点</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"87\">计算输入均值、尺度与回归系数</text><rect x=\"335\" y=\"25\" width=\"365\" height=\"88\" fill=\"#f3ece0\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"56\">测试：独立合成井，120 点 / 0.5 m 间隔</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"87\">只前向预测；真值仅用于验收</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"145\">现场应按井划分，不能把相邻深度点随机拆分后报告高分。</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a;margin-top:5px\">图 3 · 独立划分的不是随机相邻像素，而是不同井的数据来源。</figcaption></figure><p>演示固定 450 个训练样本和 120 个测试点；滑块只改变测试观测噪声与泥质影响。所有生成关系、泥质响应系数和井资料均为教学设定，不是从油田公开数据训练的现场模型。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"DIFFICULTY","title":"难度与参考方向：什么时候需要交回人工？","html":"<p>① <b>高噪声：</b>曲线误差传入孔隙度；② <b>输入超范围：</b>模型在陌生井况上外推，误差可能失控；③ <b>缺失机制：</b>气层、复杂矿物和扩径不在本例生成式中，即使曲线看起来平滑，也可能解释错误。</p><p>改进路线：先做井况与尺度校正，再引入分岩性模型、跨井验证及物理约束。真实场景无法知道每个深度的真值，应以独立岩心、井况和解释一致性复核，不能把演示中的误差红点照搬为现场报警。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-porosity\">SLB：孔隙度与中子／密度响应</a>；<a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-log-interpretation\">SLB：测井解释与多曲线背景</a>。生成式及可运行代码为独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"一口独立测试井的孔隙度解释流程","lead":["从“多条曲线靠经验合看”，变成“固定模型批量预测 + 定位需要复核的深度”。下面每一步均能在演示的输入、系数、预测与误差中找到对应。"],"stats":[["训练样本","450 点"],["独立测试","120 点"],["采样间隔","0.5 m"]],"steps":[{"name":"深度对齐与曲线质控","role":"数据","do":"把 GR、DEN、CNL 与标签统一到同一深度基准，校验单位、空值和井眼环境。本例直接生成对齐曲线，以便聚焦映射原理。","effect":"得到同一深度的一组物理响应，而不是三条错位的独立曲线。","trap":"井径异常和岩心深度归位错误会污染标签，不能靠模型自动解决。"},{"name":"只在训练井上学习映射","role":"算法","do":"用 6 口合成井共 450 点计算标准化参数，并求解岭回归系数；训练完成后固定模型。展开演示说明可以看到实际系数。","effect":"得到可复用的 GR / DEN / CNL → φ 映射，避免随测试滑块重复拟合。","trap":"若用全数据标准化或随机混入相邻深度，会造成数据泄漏。"},{"name":"独立井前向预测与范围检查","role":"解释","do":"对 120 个测试深度逐点预测，同时检查输入是否越过训练范围。并行计算直接 CNL 读数基线，保留原曲线供追溯。 点击“换一口井”可切换地层起伏、泥质段位置和固定噪声种子，考察同一个模型在不同井上的表现。","effect":"形成候选孔隙度曲线、逐点误差和待复核深度；输入输出可在相同深度线上联动查看。","trap":"岭回归不是因果解释，各特征项的数值贡献不能当作实际岩石组分。"},{"name":"按深度复核并独立验收","role":"质控","do":"统计 MAE 与误差≤2百分点的比例；点击曲线或拖动深度滑块，核对原始输入、真值、模型值与基线。导出 CSV 保留全井结果。","effect":"明确模型在哪些条件优于基线，哪些深度需要人工复核。","trap":"本例全井真值已知才可计算逐点误差；现场只能在可靠标注或岩心样点独立验收。"}],"metrics":{"title":"怎么算“做对了”：不只看一条平滑曲线","html":"<figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图 4 · 四步流程与可运行演示一一对应。\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fbfaf6\"/><g font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#242b2e\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"30\" width=\"158\" height=\"76\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"56\">01 对齐与校正</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"85\">GR / DEN / CNL</text><rect x=\"192\" y=\"30\" width=\"158\" height=\"76\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f2ece1\"/><text x=\"205\" y=\"56\">02 标准化并训练</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"85\">训练均值与系数</text><rect x=\"369\" y=\"30\" width=\"158\" height=\"76\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"56\">03 独立井解释</text><text x=\"382\" y=\"85\">φ̂(z) 与输入范围</text><rect x=\"546\" y=\"30\" width=\"158\" height=\"76\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f2ece1\"/><text x=\"559\" y=\"56\">04 误差与复核</text><text x=\"559\" y=\"85\">基线 / 误差 / 来源</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"143\">每一步都在演示中可追踪：输入曲线 → 固定模型 → 预测曲线 → 逐点核对。</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a;margin-top:5px\">图 4 · 四步流程与可运行演示一一对应。</figcaption></figure><p><b>MAE</b> = 所有测试深度的 |预测−真值| 平均值，单位为<b>孔隙度百分点</b>；预测 20%、真值 18% 的误差是 2 百分点，不是 2% 相对误差。命中比例使用 ±2 百分点门槛。复核标记取“超门槛或输入超范围”的并集，不把它包装成校准概率。</p><p>基线为 CNL 直接读数，仅用于展示泥质偏差，不代表现场最强传统方法；下一步真实验证应加入经过泥质和岩性校正的密度—中子方法。</p>"},"fails":[{"name":"泥质响应被当作孔隙","why":"CNL 偏高可能来自束缚水；需多曲线和区域认识约束。"},{"name":"噪声放大 / 基线反胜","why":"低泥质时 CNL 已接近真值，多输入的噪声可能抵消融合收益。"},{"name":"训练未覆盖的新井况","why":"矿物、气体或井眼变化可能破坏生成关系，输入不越界也不能保证正确。"}]},"demo":{"mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","label":"可运行示范","intro":"沿用老师样例的紧凑 SVG 实验台：拖动噪声与泥质滑杆，观察三条输入、候选孔隙度和误差；点击曲线逐深度解释。 点击标题右侧“换一口井 ↻”更换独立测试井，参数保留、模型固定。","height":720}}},config={"mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","label":"可运行示范","intro":"沿用老师样例的紧凑 SVG 实验台：拖动噪声与泥质滑杆，观察三条输入、候选孔隙度和误差；点击曲线逐深度解释。 点击标题右侧“换一口井 ↻”更换独立测试井，参数保留、模型固定。","height":720},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":4064,"mime":"text/html","enc":"text","data":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>示范：多曲线融合孔隙度解释</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head>\n<body><div class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\" id=\"well-name\">合成井 W001</span><h1>从测井响应到孔隙度：看见“泥质偏高”的校正</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">中子测井对含氢物质敏感，泥质中的束缚水也可能抬高读数。把中子读数直接当孔隙度，会在泥质段偏高。本例用独立标注样本学习 <b>GR + DEN + CNL → 孔隙度</b> 的映射。拖动滑杆，让输入、预测与误差同步变化；点击曲线可逐深度核对。</p></div><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"new-well\" type=\"button\">换一口井 ↻</button></div>\n<div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label for=\"noise\">观测噪声 <output id=\"out-noise\">0.6</output></label><input id=\"noise\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.6\"></div>\n<div class=\"ctl\"><label for=\"shale\">泥质影响上限 <output id=\"out-shale\">35%</output></label><input id=\"shale\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"0.65\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0.35\"></div>\n</div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts\" aria-label=\"联动曲线\"><div class=\"legend\"><span class=\"dot truth\">合成真值</span><span class=\"dot model\">多曲线模型</span><span class=\"dot base\">CNL 直接读数基线</span><span class=\"mud\">浅色带：泥质偏高段</span></div>\n<svg id=\"logs\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"自然伽马、密度和中子三条输入曲线\"></svg>\n<svg id=\"porosity\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"孔隙度真值、模型和中子直接读数对比\"></svg>\n<svg id=\"residual\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 125\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"模型和基线的逐点误差与复核阈值\"></svg>\n</section><aside class=\"demo-results\" aria-label=\"评价与逐点解释\"><div class=\"readouts\"><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\">模型 MAE</span><b id=\"mae-model\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\">基线 MAE</span><b id=\"mae-base\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\">误差 ≤ 2 百分点</span><b id=\"hit\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\">建议复核</span><b id=\"review\">—</b></div></div>\n<p id=\"note\" class=\"note\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n<section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：这个深度为什么这样解释？</h2><span id=\"point-depth\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\" for=\"point\">选择深度 <input id=\"point\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"119\" step=\"1\" value=\"62\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section>\n<details><summary>展开训练、数据假设与模型系数</summary><p>450 个训练样本来自 6 个独立合成井；本测试井 120 点、0.5 m 采样，深度 2000–2059.5 m。训练不随滑块重做，测试真值不进入预测。输入标准化与系数均仅由训练集计算。</p><p>模型：标准化线性特征的岭回归，λ=0.03。训练过程确实求解系数，并非把真值加噪声当预测。未使用深度网络。</p><div id=\"coefficients\"></div><p>生成式：GR=20+110Vsh；CNL=φ+0.18Vsh；DEN=(1−Vsh)(2.65−1.65φ)+Vsh(2.72−1.72φ)。φ、Vsh 为小数。它们只是让概念可计算的教学关系，不是现场解释标准；不模拟气层、复杂矿物和井眼扩径。</p></details>\n<div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"reset\" type=\"button\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"export\" type=\"button\">导出本次结果 CSV</button><span>同一口井滑动不随机跳动；“换一口井”更新测试井，训练模型保持固定。</span></div>\n<p class=\"note\">本例只解释孔隙度，不预测渗透率或饱和度。“复核”基于合成真值误差与训练范围检查，用于教学验收；现场没有全井真值时，需要岩心与独立质控，不能照搬此标记。所有数据均为合成资料。</p>\n</aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>\n"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7169,"mime":"text/css","enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":8979,"mime":"text/javascript","enc":"text","data":"(function(){'use strict';\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),N=120,W=720,L=48,R=14;let pending=0,result=null;\nfunction random(seed){return()=>{seed=(Math.imul(seed,1664525)+1013904223)>>>0;return seed/4294967296}}\nfunction forward(phi,vsh){return [20+110*vsh,(1-vsh)*(2.65-1.65*phi)+vsh*(2.72-1.72*phi),phi+.18*vsh]}\nfunction solve(a){let n=a.length;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let pivot=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(a[j][i])>Math.abs(a[pivot][i]))pivot=j;[a[i],a[pivot]]=[a[pivot],a[i]];let d=a[i][i];for(let k=i;k<=n;k++)a[i][k]/=d;for(let j=0;j<n;j++)if(j!==i){let m=a[j][i];for(let k=i;k<=n;k++)a[j][k]-=m*a[i][k]}}return a.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst train=(()=>{let r=random(1703),data=[];for(let well=0;well<6;well++)for(let i=0;i<75;i++){let phi=.05+.25*r(),vsh=.65*r(),logs=forward(phi,vsh);logs=logs.map((v,j)=>v+(r()-.5)*[3,.012,.008][j]);data.push({logs,phi,well})}return data})();\nconst means=[0,1,2].map(j=>train.reduce((s,d)=>s+d.logs[j],0)/train.length),scales=[0,1,2].map(j=>Math.sqrt(train.reduce((s,d)=>s+(d.logs[j]-means[j])**2,0)/train.length)),limits=[0,1,2].map(j=>[Math.min(...train.map(d=>d.logs[j])),Math.max(...train.map(d=>d.logs[j]))]);\nconst weights=(()=>{let a=Array.from({length:4},()=>Array(5).fill(0));for(const d of train){let f=[1,...d.logs.map((v,j)=>(v-means[j])/scales[j])];for(let i=0;i<4;i++){for(let j=0;j<4;j++)a[i][j]+=f[i]*f[j];a[i][4]+=f[i]*d.phi}}for(let i=1;i<4;i++)a[i][i]+=.03;return solve(a)})();\nfunction predict(logs){return weights[0]+logs.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+weights[j+1]*(v-means[j])/scales[j],0)}\n// A test well is generated once; sliders change its conditions, not its identity.\nfunction makeWell(seed){const r=random(seed),start=25+Math.floor(r()*25),end=start+25+Math.floor(r()*20),mean=.125+.035*r(),amplitude=.025+.025*r(),wavelength=10+10*r(),phase=r()*6,step=.02+.025*r();return {seed,start,end,phi:Array.from({length:N},(_,i)=>mean+amplitude*Math.sin(i/wavelength+phase)+(i>=start&&i<end?step:0)),vshFactor:Array.from({length:N},(_,i)=>i>=start&&i<end?.8+.2*Math.sin(i/7+phase)**2:.08+.1*Math.sin(i/17+phase)**2),noise:Array.from({length:N},()=>[r()+r()-1,r()+r()-1,r()+r()-1])}}\nlet wellIndex=0,well=makeWell(9107);\nfunction wellName(){return 'W'+String(wellIndex+1).padStart(3,'0')}\n\nfunction compute(nl,sh){let logs=[],truth=[],pred=[],base=[],errors=[],bad=[],outside=[];for(let i=0;i<N;i++){let phi=well.phi[i],vs=sh*well.vshFactor[i],raw=forward(phi,vs),x=raw.map((v,j)=>v+well.noise[i][j]*nl*[7,.025,.018][j]),p=predict(x),e=(p-phi)*100,ood=x.some((v,j)=>v<limits[j][0]||v>limits[j][1]);logs.push(x);truth.push(phi*100);pred.push(p*100);base.push(x[2]*100);errors.push(e);outside.push(ood);bad.push(Math.abs(e)>2||ood)}let mae=a=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-truth[i]),0)/N;return{logs,truth,pred,base,errors,bad,outside,mae:mae(pred),maeBase:mae(base),hit:100*errors.filter(e=>Math.abs(e)<=2).length/N}}\nconst x=i=>L+i/(N-1)*(W-L-R),fmt=v=>Number(v).toFixed(1),path=(a,lo,hi,top,height)=>a.map((v,i)=>(i?'L':'M')+x(i).toFixed(1)+' '+(top+(hi-v)/(hi-lo)*height).toFixed(1)).join('');\nfunction grid(lo,hi,top,height,label){let s='<text x=\"54\" y=\"'+(top-4)+'\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#4d565b\">'+label+'</text>';for(let k=0;k<3;k++){let v=lo+(hi-lo)*k/2,y=top+height*(1-k/2);s+='<line x1=\"'+L+'\" y1=\"'+y+'\" x2=\"706\" y2=\"'+y+'\" stroke=\"#efece1\"/><text x=\"43\" y=\"'+(y+3)+'\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"end\">'+(hi-lo<1?v.toFixed(2):v.toFixed(0))+'</text>'}return s}\nfunction band(h){return '<rect x=\"'+x(well.start)+'\" y=\"10\" width=\"'+(x(well.end)-x(well.start))+'\" height=\"'+h+'\" fill=\"#f4f7eb\"/>'}\nfunction cursor(height){let i=+$('point').value;return '<line x1=\"'+x(i)+'\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"'+x(i)+'\" y2=\"'+height+'\" stroke=\"#9ba3a9\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/>'}\nfunction depthAxis(y){let s='';for(let i of [0,30,60,90,119])s+='<text x=\"'+x(i)+'\" y=\"'+y+'\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">'+(2000+i*.5).toFixed(1)+'</text>';return s+'<text x=\"706\" y=\"'+(y+13)+'\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\">深度 m →</text>'}\nfunction curve(a,lo,hi,top,h,color,dash=''){return '<path d=\"'+path(a,lo,hi,top,h)+'\" stroke=\"'+color+'\" stroke-width=\"1.35\" fill=\"none\"'+(dash?' stroke-dasharray=\"'+dash+'\"':'')+'/>'}\nfunction render(){const d=result;let s=band(195);let configs=[[0,0,120,18,45,'GR / API','#41699b'],[1,2.15,2.75,83,45,'DEN / g·cm⁻³','#9a7656'],[2,0,.45,148,45,'CNL / v/v','#627b54']];for(const [j,lo,hi,top,h,label,color]of configs){s+=grid(lo,hi,top,h,label)+curve(d.logs.map(v=>v[j]),lo,hi,top,h,color)}$('logs').innerHTML=s+cursor(198)+depthAxis(212);\nlet p=band(130)+grid(0,45,16,120,'φ / %');p+=curve(d.base,0,45,16,120,'#41699b')+curve(d.truth,0,45,16,120,'#2f7d6b','5 3')+curve(d.pred,0,45,16,120,'#b26a39');d.bad.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v)p+='<circle cx=\"'+x(i)+'\" cy=\"'+(16+(45-d.pred[i])/45*120)+'\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/>'});$('porosity').innerHTML=p+cursor(138)+depthAxis(158);\nlet e=band(85)+grid(-16,16,16,70,'误差/百分点');for(let v of [-2,2])e+='<line x1=\"48\" x2=\"706\" y1=\"'+(16+(16-v)/32*70)+'\" y2=\"'+(16+(16-v)/32*70)+'\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\" opacity=\".4\"/>';e+=curve(d.base.map((v,i)=>v-d.truth[i]),-16,16,16,70,'#41699b')+curve(d.errors,-16,16,16,70,'#b26a39');$('residual').innerHTML=e+cursor(90)+depthAxis(106);\n$('mae-model').textContent=d.mae.toFixed(2)+' 百分点';$('mae-base').textContent=d.maeBase.toFixed(2)+' 百分点';$('hit').textContent=d.hit.toFixed(1)+'%';$('review').textContent=d.bad.filter(Boolean).length+' / '+N+' 点';$('note').innerHTML=d.mae<d.maeBase?'多曲线模型在本次合成井上的误差较小。观察浅色泥质段：<b>蓝色基线可能系统偏高</b>，陶土色预测更接近绿色真值。试着增大噪声，看红点如何出现。':'本次多曲线模型没有优于直接读数。<b>学习方法并非总能胜出</b>：低泥质时基线本就接近真值，新增观测噪声可能抵消融合收益。';inspect()}\nfunction inspect(){let i=+$('point').value,d=result,logs=d.logs[i];$('point-depth').textContent=(2000+i*.5).toFixed(1)+' m';$('point-values').innerHTML=[['GR',logs[0].toFixed(1)+' API'],['DEN',logs[1].toFixed(3)+' g/cm³'],['CNL',logs[2].toFixed(3)+' v/v'],['真值 / 预测',d.truth[i].toFixed(2)+' / '+d.pred[i].toFixed(2)+'%']].map(([k,v])=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+v+'</b></div>').join('');let contributions=logs.map((v,j)=>weights[j+1]*(v-means[j])/scales[j]*100);$('point-explain').textContent='模型拆解：截距 '+(weights[0]*100).toFixed(2)+'，GR 项 '+contributions[0].toFixed(2)+'，DEN 项 '+contributions[1].toFixed(2)+'，CNL 项 '+contributions[2].toFixed(2)+'，相加得 '+d.pred[i].toFixed(2)+'%。这些项是模型数值贡献，不是物理体积组分。该点误差 '+d.errors[i].toFixed(2)+' 百分点；'+(d.outside[i]?'至少一条输入超出训练范围，应复核。':Math.abs(d.errors[i])>2?'超出教学误差门槛，应复核。':'本次合成验收误差在 ±2 百分点内。')}\nfunction draw(){$('well-name').textContent='合成井 '+wellName()+' · 种子 '+well.seed;const nl=+$('noise').value,sh=+$('shale').value;$('out-noise').textContent=nl.toFixed(2);$('out-shale').textContent=(sh*100).toFixed(0)+'%';result=compute(nl,sh);render()}\nfunction schedule(){if(!pending)pending=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{pending=0;draw()})}function flush(){if(pending){cancelAnimationFrame(pending);pending=0}draw()}\nfor(let id of ['noise','shale']){$(id).addEventListener('input',schedule);$(id).addEventListener('change',flush)}$('point').addEventListener('input',render);for(let id of ['logs','porosity','residual'])$(id).addEventListener('click',e=>{let rect=$(id).getBoundingClientRect(),vx=(e.clientX-rect.left)/rect.width*W;$('point').value=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(N-1,(vx-L)/(W-L-R)*(N-1))));render()});\n$('new-well').addEventListener('click',()=>{wellIndex++;well=makeWell(9107+wellIndex*7919);flush()});\n$('reset').addEventListener('click',()=>{wellIndex=0;well=makeWell(9107);$('noise').value=.6;$('shale').value=.35;$('point').value=62;flush()});$('export').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(pending)flush();let d=result,rows=[['well_id','test_seed','depth_m','GR_API','DEN_g_cm3','CNL_vv','truth_phi_pct','predicted_phi_pct','baseline_phi_pct','error_pp','outside_training_range','review_flag'],...d.logs.map((v,i)=>[wellName(),well.seed,2000+i*.5,...v,d.truth[i],d.pred[i],d.base[i],d.errors[i],+d.outside[i],+d.bad[i]])],blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+rows.map(r=>r.join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='welllog-porosity-'+wellName()+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)});\n$('coefficients').innerHTML='<table><tr><th>标准化特征</th><th>均值</th><th>标准差</th><th>系数</th></tr>'+['GR','DEN','CNL'].map((v,j)=>'<tr><td>'+v+'</td><td>'+means[j].toFixed(4)+'</td><td>'+scales[j].toFixed(4)+'</td><td>'+weights[j+1].toFixed(5)+'</td></tr>').join('')+'</table>';draw();\n})();\n"}];c.tabs.demo={label:'可运行示范',mount(root){const host=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo:config},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>host.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"welllog-fracture-context-v22","sceneId":"w3","title":"成像测井裂缝识别：邻域特征逻辑回归","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-01","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"井壁展开图上，倾斜平面交线可呈正弦形，而仪器条带也可能很暗。本例学习灰度与上下邻域对比，减少“所有暗点都算裂缝”的误判。拖动阈值与噪声，点击图像选择深度；换井会改变候选暗带和工具伪影。","judge":[{"label":"学习或算法","value":"邻域特征逻辑回归","desc":"实际计算并展示模型/证据"},{"label":"训练资料","value":"4 图 / 1600 像素","desc":"与当前测试井独立"},{"label":"可视验收","value":"像素 F1","desc":"基线、错误与逐深度核对"},{"label":"难点","value":"高","desc":"本例只分割候选暗带，不识别天然/诱导属性、开度或导流性。所有数据均为合成，像素指标不能当作现场精度。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"PROBLEM","title":"当前做法与问题：先理解专业对象","html":"<p>电成像与声成像把井壁的物理响应展开为“方位—深度”图，常用于裂缝型储层认识。<b>倾斜平面与圆柱井壁的交线</b>展开后可能呈正弦形；层理、裂缝、孔洞和井壁损伤仍需结合上下文辨别。</p><figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图 1 · 正弦形与条带的几何区别。示意图不反算真实产状。\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fbfaf6\"/><g fill=\"#242b2e\" font-size=\"13\"><path d=\"M20 80Q55 20 90 80T160 80T230 80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M110 18V140\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"8\" opacity=\".6\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"46\">弯曲暗带：可能的地质界面</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"82\">竖直暗带：也可能是仪器/井壁伪影</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"118\">“暗”是响应，不是天然裂缝的充分证据</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a;margin-top:5px\">图 1 · 正弦形与条带的几何区别。示意图不反算真实产状。</figcaption></figure><p>人工逐条追踪既费时，也会受对比度和经验影响。单一灰度阈值常把工具条带当作裂缝，或者为减少误报把弱裂缝一起漏掉。误检会影响后续裂缝模型，<b>候选掩膜不能直接用于产能结论</b>。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"INTERVENTION","title":"算法介入点：输入如何变成候选","html":"<p>本例将像素转为“暗度、上下邻域对比、上下梯度”三个可解释特征，用四幅独立合成图的均衡标注像素训练<b>逻辑回归</b>。灰度低但纵向一直很暗的条带，往往缺少跨暗带的上下对比；细曲线周围则可能具有更明显的邻域证据。</p><figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"四步计算链：不同工序承担不同的误差与质控责任。\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fbfaf6\"/><g fill=\"#242b2e\" font-size=\"13\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"52\">01</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"83\">独立标注图</text><rect x=\"192\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f2ece1\"/><text x=\"205\" y=\"52\">02</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"83\">学习邻域映射</text><rect x=\"369\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"52\">03</text><text x=\"382\" y=\"83\">阈值化分数</text><rect x=\"546\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f2ece1\"/><text x=\"559\" y=\"52\">04</text><text x=\"559\" y=\"83\">逐深度复核</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"145\">训练、输入、输出和验收在演示里逐一可见，真值只用于独立评价。</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a;margin-top:5px\">四步计算链：不同工序承担不同的误差与质控责任。</figcaption></figure><p>训练固定后，测试只计算输入特征与分数，再按滑杆阈值输出掩膜。权重可展开查看。它不是深度分割网络，也未拟合裂缝平面、天然/诱导类型或开度；<b>模型分数未经概率校准</b>。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"需要准备什么：数据、标注与独立验证","html":"<p><b>真实资料：</b>同分辨率的井壁图、仪器质量/覆盖率信息、专家掩膜及复核来源。应按井或图幅隔离训练和测试，避免相邻像素泄漏；低覆盖、井壁扩径和动态色标也必须做质控。</p><p><b>教学资料：</b>四幅训练图，每幅随机抽取 200 个暗带和 200 个背景像素；独立测试井壁为 96 方位列×120 深度行，0.05 m/行。测试真值只统计像素指标，不参与特征、训练或判别。换井改变合成暗带和伪影位置。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"DIFFICULTY","title":"难度与参考方向：哪些结论不能越界","html":"<p>阈值低可能误报，高可能漏检；交点、噪声和弱对比都可能破坏邻域特征。原理成立不等于面对真实井壁仍有效，下一步应加入仪器质控、真实图幅验证和结构连续性约束。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/products-and-services/innovating-in-oil-and-gas/reservoir-characterization/interpretation-and-analysis/interpretation-and-design/fracture-and-fault-characterization\">SLB：裂缝与井壁图解释背景</a>；<a href=\"https://infoterre.brgm.fr/rapports/RP-50835-FR.pdf\">BRGM：井壁图正弦迹线与解释</a>。本例图像与参数均为合成教学设定。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"成像测井裂缝识别：从输入到可复核结果","lead":["每一步都对应演示中的输入、固定模型、输出与验收，不以一条平滑曲线替代质控。"],"stats":[["训练与测试","独立井/图"],["交互","换井 / 联动"],["实现","纯前端"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 井壁展开图与像素标签","role":"数据","do":"规范方位、深度和像素尺度；剔除覆盖缺失。本例生成独立合成训练图和测试图，保留竖直条带伪影。","effect":"输入图、掩膜和质量背景","trap":"低灰度不能直接作为标签。"},{"name":"02 提取邻域并学习分类","role":"算法","do":"计算暗度、上下邻域对比和上下梯度；1600 个均衡标注像素训练逻辑回归 500 轮，之后固定权重。","effect":"可查看的特征系数","trap":"均衡采样分数不是现场发生概率。"},{"name":"03 独立图前向分割","role":"推理","do":"对当前井壁图逐像素评分，以可调阈值输出掩膜；不读取测试标签。","effect":"绿色候选像素与逐深度比例","trap":"阈值过严或过松都有代价，不能只挑好看的图。"},{"name":"04 沿深度核查误报漏报","role":"质控","do":"对照合成真值算 F1、精确率、召回与误报数；点击图像/曲线核对某个深度，导出全图结果。","effect":"可追踪的候选与误差","trap":"行内像素比例不是裂缝密度或开度。"}],"metrics":{"title":"怎么算“做对了”","html":"<figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"四步计算链：不同工序承担不同的误差与质控责任。\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fbfaf6\"/><g fill=\"#242b2e\" font-size=\"13\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"52\">01</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"83\">井壁展开图与像素标</text><rect x=\"192\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f2ece1\"/><text x=\"205\" y=\"52\">02</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"83\">提取邻域并学习分类</text><rect x=\"369\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"52\">03</text><text x=\"382\" y=\"83\">独立图前向分割</text><rect x=\"546\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f2ece1\"/><text x=\"559\" y=\"52\">04</text><text x=\"559\" y=\"83\">沿深度核查误报漏报</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"145\">训练、输入、输出和验收在演示里逐一可见，真值只用于独立评价。</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a;margin-top:5px\">四步计算链：不同工序承担不同的误差与质控责任。</figcaption></figure><p>F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)，同时报告精确率、召回率与误报像素。指标逐像素计算，行内像素比例不等于裂缝条数。</p>"},"fails":[{"name":"条带误报","why":"持续暗条可能被误当作界面；简单邻域不能解决全部伪影。"},{"name":"弱迹线漏检","why":"低对比度和噪声会削弱特征，阈值高时更明显。"},{"name":"过度解释","why":"候选掩膜不等于天然导流裂缝，不反演真实产状或产能。"}]},"demo":{"mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","label":"可运行示范","intro":"井壁展开图上，倾斜平面交线可呈正弦形，而仪器条带也可能很暗。本例学习灰度与上下邻域对比，减少“所有暗点都算裂缝”的误判。拖动阈值与噪声，点击图像选择深度；换井会改变候选暗带和工具伪影。","height":740}}},config={"mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","label":"可运行示范","intro":"井壁展开图上，倾斜平面交线可呈正弦形，而仪器条带也可能很暗。本例学习灰度与上下邻域对比，减少“所有暗点都算裂缝”的误判。拖动阈值与噪声，点击图像选择深度；换井会改变候选暗带和工具伪影。","height":740},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":3507,"mime":"text/html","enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>成像测井裂缝识别 · v2.2 风格</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\" id=\"well-name\">独立合成测试井</span><h1>暗带不一定是裂缝：让邻域证据参与判断</h1><p class=\"lead\">井壁展开图上，倾斜平面交线可呈正弦形，而仪器条带也可能很暗。本例学习灰度与上下邻域对比，减少“所有暗点都算裂缝”的误判。拖动阈值与噪声，点击图像选择深度；换井会改变候选暗带和工具伪影。</p></div><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"new-well\" type=\"button\">换一口井 ↻</button></div><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label for=\"noise\">观测噪声 <output id=\"out-noise\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.35\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label for=\"param\">候选响应阈值 <output id=\"out-param\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.2\" max=\"0.9\" step=\"0.02\" value=\"0.5\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts\" aria-label=\"输入输出联动图\"><div class=\"legend\"><span class=\"dot truth\">合成真值比例</span><span class=\"dot model\">模型候选比例</span><span class=\"dot base\">灰度阈值比例</span></div><div class=\"image-pair\"><figure><figcaption>原始井壁图（深度向下）</figcaption><canvas id=\"raw-image\" width=\"360\" height=\"500\" aria-label=\"合成井壁图\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>模型候选掩膜（绿）</figcaption><canvas id=\"mask-image\" width=\"360\" height=\"500\" aria-label=\"裂缝候选掩膜\"></canvas></figure></div><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 130\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐深度质控曲线\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\" aria-label=\"指标和逐点解释\"><div class=\"readouts\"><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml0\">像素 F1</span><b id=\"m0\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml1\">固定灰度 F1</span><b id=\"m1\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml2\">精确 / 召回</span><b id=\"m2\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml3\">误报像素</span><b id=\"m3\">—</b></div></div><p id=\"note\" class=\"note\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐深度核对：输入、模型与来源</h2><span id=\"point-depth\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\" for=\"point\">选择深度 <input id=\"point\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"119\" step=\"1\" value=\"62\"></label><div class=\"point-values\" id=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型、训练与验收口径</summary><p class=\"model-copy\">模型为固定权重的逻辑回归。右表显示实际系数；点击某深度，比较候选像素与真值比例，定位误报或漏报。训练和测试来自不同合成图。</p><div id=\"coefficients\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"reset\" type=\"button\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"export\" type=\"button\">导出本次 CSV</button><span>同井滑动不随机跳动；换井只更换独立测试资料，训练模型固定。</span></div><p class=\"note\">本例只分割候选暗带，不识别天然/诱导属性、开度或导流性。所有数据均为合成，像素指标不能当作现场精度。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7719,"mime":"text/css","enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.image-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px}.image-pair figure{margin:0;min-width:0}.image-pair figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.image-pair canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:white}#result-plot,#diagnostic{margin-top:8px}.model-copy{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}.model-copy p{line-height:1.8}.demo-results table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.demo-results td,.demo-results th{padding:4px}"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":11029,"mime":"text/javascript","enc":"text","data":"(function(){\nconst SPEC={\"key\":\"fracture\",\"step\":0.05,\"image\":true,\"noise\":0.35,\"value\":0.5};SPEC.format=p=>p.toFixed(2);\n'use strict';\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),N=120,W=720,L=48,R=14,names=['砂岩','泥岩','灰岩'],colors=['#bc9457','#6d8a72','#7395b6'];\nfunction random(seed){return()=>{seed=(Math.imul(seed,1664525)+1013904223)>>>0;return seed/4294967296}}\nconst clamp=(x,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,x)),average=a=>a.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/a.length;\nfunction solve(a){for(let i=0;i<a.length;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<a.length;j++)if(Math.abs(a[j][i])>Math.abs(a[p][i]))p=j;[a[i],a[p]]=[a[p],a[i]];let d=a[i][i];for(let k=i;k<=a.length;k++)a[i][k]/=d;for(let j=0;j<a.length;j++)if(j!==i){let m=a[j][i];for(let k=i;k<=a.length;k++)a[j][k]-=m*a[i][k]}}return a.map(row=>row[a.length])}\nfunction fit(data){const d=data[0].x.length,means=Array.from({length:d},(_,j)=>average(data.map(v=>v.x[j]))),scales=means.map((m,j)=>Math.sqrt(average(data.map(v=>(v.x[j]-m)**2)))||1),a=Array.from({length:d+1},()=>Array(d+2).fill(0));for(let v of data){let x=[1,...v.x.map((v,j)=>(v-means[j])/scales[j])];for(let i=0;i<=d;i++){for(let j=0;j<=d;j++)a[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];a[i][d+1]+=x[i]*v.y}}for(let j=1;j<=d;j++)a[j][j]+=.05;let weights=solve(a);return{means,scales,weights,predict(x){return weights[0]+x.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+weights[j+1]*(v-means[j])/scales[j],0)}}}\nfunction synth(seed){const r=random(seed),boundaries=[0];while(boundaries.length<6)boundaries.push(boundaries.at(-1)+14+Math.floor(r()*9));boundaries.push(N);let classes=[];for(let k=0;k<6;k++){let c=Math.floor(r()*3);if(k&&c===classes[k-1])c=(c+1)%3;classes.push(c)}let logs=[],labels=[];for(let i=0;i<N;i++){let layer=0;while(layer<5&&i>=boundaries[layer+1])layer++;let k=classes[layer],phi=.08+.12*r(),base=[[40,2.52-phi*.8,.10+phi*.5],[110,2.57,.31],[25,2.77-phi*.5,.07+phi*.25]][k];logs.push(base.map((v,j)=>v+(r()-.5)*[8,.04,.025][j]));labels.push(k)}return{logs,labels,boundaries,noise:Array.from({length:N},()=>[r()+r()-1,r()+r()-1,r()+r()-1]),gapCenter:53+Math.floor(r()*25)}}\nfunction path(arr,lo,hi,top,height){let p='',on=false;for(let i=0;i<arr.length;i++){let v=arr[i];if(v===null||!Number.isFinite(v)){on=false;continue}p+=(on?'L':'M')+xx(i).toFixed(1)+' '+(top+(hi-v)/(hi-lo)*height).toFixed(1);on=true}return p}\nconst xx=i=>L+i/(N-1)*(W-L-R);\nfunction curve(a,lo,hi,top,height,color,dash=''){return '<path d=\"'+path(a,lo,hi,top,height)+'\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"'+color+'\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"'+(dash?' stroke-dasharray=\"'+dash+'\"':'')+'/>'}\nfunction grid(lo,hi,top,height,label){let s='<text x=\"52\" y=\"'+(top-4)+'\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#4d565b\">'+label+'</text>';for(let k=0;k<3;k++){let y=top+height*k/2,v=hi-(hi-lo)*k/2;s+='<line x1=\"48\" y1=\"'+y+'\" x2=\"706\" y2=\"'+y+'\" stroke=\"#efece1\"/><text x=\"43\" y=\"'+(y+3)+'\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\">'+(hi-lo<1?v.toFixed(2):v.toFixed(0))+'</text>'}return s}\nfunction axis(y){let s='';for(let i of [0,30,60,90,119])s+='<text x=\"'+xx(i)+'\" y=\"'+y+'\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">'+(2000+i*SPEC.step).toFixed(2)+'</text>';return s+'<text x=\"706\" y=\"'+(y+13)+'\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\">深度 m →</text>'}\nfunction cursor(height){let i=+$('point').value;return '<line x1=\"'+xx(i)+'\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"'+xx(i)+'\" y2=\"'+height+'\" stroke=\"#9ba3a9\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/>'}\nfunction band(start,end,height){return '<rect x=\"'+xx(start)+'\" y=\"10\" width=\"'+(xx(end)-xx(start))+'\" height=\"'+height+'\" fill=\"#f4f7eb\"/>'}\nfunction setMetrics(values){values.forEach(([label,value],i)=>{$('ml'+i).textContent=label;$('m'+i).textContent=value})}\nfunction values(items,text){$('point-values').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><b>'+b+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=text}\nfunction f1(pred,truth){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;pred.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return {precision:tp/Math.max(1,tp+fp),recall:tp/Math.max(1,tp+fn),f:2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn),tp,fp,fn}}\nfunction table(headers,rows){return '<table><tr>'+headers.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+v+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>'}\nlet wellIndex=0,well=null,result=null,pending=0;const wellName=()=> 'W'+String(wellIndex+1).padStart(3,'0');\nfunction refresh(){const nl=+$('noise').value,p=+$('param').value;$('out-noise').textContent=nl.toFixed(2);$('out-param').textContent=SPEC.format(p);$('well-name').textContent='合成井 '+wellName()+' · 测试种子 '+well.seed;result=compute(well,nl,p);render();inspect();}\nfunction schedule(){if(!pending)pending=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{pending=0;refresh()})}\nfunction flush(){if(pending){cancelAnimationFrame(pending);pending=0}refresh()}\nfunction initialize(){well=makeWell(9107);for(let id of ['noise','param']){$(id).addEventListener('input',schedule);$(id).addEventListener('change',flush)}$('new-well').addEventListener('click',()=>{wellIndex++;well=makeWell(9107+7919*wellIndex);flush()});$('reset').addEventListener('click',()=>{wellIndex=0;well=makeWell(9107);$('noise').value=SPEC.noise;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('point').value=62;flush()});$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{render();inspect()});for(let id of ['input-plot','result-plot','diagnostic']){let e=$(id);if(!e)continue;e.addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=e.getBoundingClientRect(),vx=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*W;$('point').value=Math.round(clamp((vx-L)/(W-L-R)*(N-1),0,N-1));render();inspect()})}if(SPEC.image)for(let id of ['raw-image','mask-image'])$(id).addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$(id).getBoundingClientRect(),vy=(ev.clientY-r.top)/r.height*500;$('point').value=Math.round(clamp((vy-20)/440*(N-1),0,N-1));render();inspect()});$('export').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(pending)flush();let report=csvRows(),quote=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[report.head,...report.rows].map(r=>r.map(quote).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=SPEC.key+'-'+wellName()+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)});refresh()}\n\nconst IMG_W=96;\nfunction makeWell(seed){let r=random(seed),count=2+Math.floor(r()*2),lines=Array.from({length:count},(_,k)=>({center:(k+1)*N/(count+1),amp:5+8*r(),phase:r()*Math.PI*2})),stripe=15+Math.floor(r()*60),truth=[],clean=[],noise=[];for(let y=0;y<N;y++)for(let x=0;x<IMG_W;x++){let hit=lines.some(l=>Math.abs(y-l.center-l.amp*Math.sin(x/IMG_W*2*Math.PI+l.phase))<1.2),artifact=Math.abs(x-stripe)<1.5;truth.push(hit?1:0);clean.push(hit||artifact?.19:.76+.025*Math.sin(y/13));noise.push(r()+r()-1)}return {seed,truth,clean,noise,lines,stripe}}\nfunction image(w,nl){return w.clean.map((v,i)=>clamp(v+w.noise[i]*nl*.7,0,1))}\nfunction pixelFeatures(a,x,y){const at=dy=>a[clamp(y+dy,0,N-1)*IMG_W+x],v=at(0);return [1,1-v,Math.max(0,(at(-3)+at(3))/2-v),Math.abs(at(-3)-at(3))]}\nconst training=(()=>{let samples=[];for(let k=0;k<4;k++){let w=makeWell(3101+k*97),a=image(w,.35),r=random(704+k),counts=[0,0];while(counts[0]<200||counts[1]<200){let x=Math.floor(r()*IMG_W),y=3+Math.floor(r()*(N-6)),label=w.truth[y*IMG_W+x];if(counts[label]>=200)continue;counts[label]++;samples.push({x:pixelFeatures(a,x,y),y:label})}}return samples})();\nconst model=(()=>{let weights=[0,0,0,0];for(let epoch=0;epoch<500;epoch++){let gradient=[0,0,0,0];for(let d of training){let logit=d.x.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+v*weights[j],0),p=1/(1+Math.exp(-logit));for(let j=0;j<4;j++)gradient[j]+=(p-d.y)*d.x[j]}for(let j=0;j<4;j++)weights[j]-=.3*(gradient[j]/training.length+(j?.001*weights[j]:0))}return weights})();\nfunction compute(w,nl,threshold){let a=image(w,nl),scores=[],mask=[],base=[];for(let y=0;y<N;y++)for(let x=0;x<IMG_W;x++){let f=pixelFeatures(a,x,y),s=1/(1+Math.exp(-f.reduce((v,f,j)=>v+f*model[j],0)));scores.push(s);mask.push(s>=threshold?1:0);base.push(a[y*IMG_W+x]<.4?1:0)}let stats=f1(mask,w.truth),baseline=f1(base,w.truth),rows=Array.from({length:N},(_,y)=>{let slice=a=>a.slice(y*IMG_W,(y+1)*IMG_W);return{fraction:average(slice(mask)),truth:average(slice(w.truth)),baseline:average(slice(base)),score:average(slice(scores))}});return {a,scores,mask,base,stats,baseline,rows}}\nfunction drawImage(id,raw){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),d=result;g.clearRect(0,0,360,500);for(let y=0;y<N;y++)for(let x=0;x<IMG_W;x++){let i=y*IMG_W+x;if(raw){let v=Math.round(d.a[i]*255);g.fillStyle='rgb('+v+','+v+','+v+')'}else g.fillStyle=d.mask[i]?'#2f7d6b':'#f4f5ed';g.fillRect(30+x*310/IMG_W,20+y*440/N,310/IMG_W+1,440/N+1)}let y=20+(+$('point').value+.5)*440/N;g.strokeStyle='#b26a39';g.lineWidth=1.5;g.beginPath();g.moveTo(30,y);g.lineTo(340,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#79828a';g.font='10px sans-serif';for(let row of [0,40,80,119])g.fillText((2000+row*.05).toFixed(1),0,20+row*440/N);g.fillText('方位 0°',30,480);g.fillText('360°',310,480)}\nfunction render(){let d=result;drawImage('raw-image',true);drawImage('mask-image',false);$('diagnostic').innerHTML=grid(0,.6,18,72,'逐深度候选暗带像素比例（非裂缝条数）')+curve(d.rows.map(v=>v.truth),0,.6,18,72,'#2f7d6b','5 3')+curve(d.rows.map(v=>v.fraction),0,.6,18,72,'#b26a39')+curve(d.rows.map(v=>v.baseline),0,.6,18,72,'#41699b')+cursor(94)+axis(112);setMetrics([['像素 F1',d.stats.f.toFixed(3)],['固定灰度 F1',d.baseline.f.toFixed(3)],['精确 / 召回',d.stats.precision.toFixed(2)+' / '+d.stats.recall.toFixed(2)],['误报像素',String(d.stats.fp)]]);$('note').innerHTML='输入图中的竖直暗条是<b>工具条带伪影</b>，并不是裂缝真值。分类器结合灰度与上下邻域对比，尝试减少“所有暗点都是裂缝”的误判；它仍可能漏掉弱响应或混淆交点。';$('coefficients').innerHTML=table(['输入项','已训练系数'],['截距','暗度 1−I','上下邻域对比','上下梯度'].map((v,j)=>[v,model[j].toFixed(4)]))+'<p>四幅独立合成训练图，1600 个均衡标注像素；逻辑回归 500 轮。模型分数未经过概率校准，当前阈值只决定候选掩膜。</p>'}\nfunction inspect(){let i=+$('point').value,d=result,row=d.rows[i];$('point-depth').textContent=(2000+i*.05).toFixed(2)+' m';values([['预测 / 真值像素比例',(row.fraction*100).toFixed(1)+' / '+(row.truth*100).toFixed(1)+'%'],['该行平均响应',row.score.toFixed(3)],['所用分割阈值',Number($('param').value).toFixed(2)],['图像方位范围','0–360° 展开']], '橙色横线选中该深度。比例是这一行被标记的像素占比，不是开度或裂缝密度。本例不拟合三维产状、天然/诱导属性或导流性；正弦形暗带只是候选，需要结合成像质量、地质与岩心复核。')}\nfunction csvRows(){let d=result;return {head:['well_id','seed','depth_m','azimuth_deg','intensity','model_score','truth_mask','predicted_mask','threshold_mask'],rows:d.a.map((v,i)=>[wellName(),well.seed,2000+Math.floor(i/IMG_W)*.05,(i%IMG_W)/IMG_W*360,v,d.scores[i],well.truth[i],d.mask[i],d.base[i]])}}\ninitialize();\n\n})();"}];c.tabs.demo={label:'可运行示范',mount(root){const host=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo:config},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>host.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"welllog-lithology-bayes-v22","sceneId":"w4","title":"岩性识别：高斯朴素贝叶斯","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-01","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"GR 提供泥质线索，但低 GR 的砂岩和灰岩仍可能混淆。本例学习 GR、DEN、CNL 的类内响应分布，逐深度输出三类岩性候选。调节噪声与 GR 系统偏移，看模型如何在新井上失准；换井会改变层序与层厚。","judge":[{"label":"学习或算法","value":"高斯朴素贝叶斯","desc":"实际计算并展示模型/证据"},{"label":"训练资料","value":"6 井 / 720 点","desc":"与当前测试井独立"},{"label":"可视验收","value":"三曲线准确率","desc":"基线、错误与逐深度核对"},{"label":"难点","value":"中","desc":"岩性类别是合成候选，不等于现场定名或地层年代。模型权重不作校准概率解释。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"PROBLEM","title":"当前做法与问题：先理解专业对象","html":"<p>岩性定名为储层评价和层间对比提供基础。自然伽马（GR）可提供泥质线索，但密度和中子响应也受孔隙、矿物与流体影响；<b>同一条曲线的区间并不只对应一种岩石</b>。</p><figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图 1 · 示意关系用于理解特征互补，不是适用于所有地区的岩性阈值。\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fbfaf6\"/><g fill=\"#242b2e\" font-size=\"13\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"22\" width=\"150\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#f0e7d5\"/><text x=\"35\" y=\"55\">砂岩：可能低 GR</text><text x=\"35\" y=\"91\">孔隙影响 DEN/CNL</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"22\" width=\"150\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#e3ece3\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"55\">泥岩：常见高 GR</text><text x=\"215\" y=\"91\">中子响应偏高</text><rect x=\"380\" y=\"22\" width=\"150\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#e4ebf2\"/><text x=\"395\" y=\"55\">灰岩：也可能低 GR</text><text x=\"395\" y=\"91\">密度响应不同</text><text x=\"555\" y=\"63\">多曲线联合</text><text x=\"555\" y=\"98\">仍需标定</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a;margin-top:5px\">图 1 · 示意关系用于理解特征互补，不是适用于所有地区的岩性阈值。</figcaption></figure><p>只用 GR 划分“砂/泥”时，灰岩可能被硬塞进砂岩。人工交会图也会受区块经验与样本不足影响。真正目标是给出<b>可复核的岩性候选和误判位置</b>，而不是把色带当成地层真相。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"INTERVENTION","title":"算法介入点：输入如何变成候选","html":"<p>本例用六口独立训练井学习每类 GR、DEN、CNL 的均值、方差和先验比例，采用<b>高斯朴素贝叶斯</b>计算类别分数。它让“该点更像哪种已知岩性响应”成为一个可计算问题。</p><figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"四步计算链：不同工序承担不同的误差与质控责任。\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fbfaf6\"/><g fill=\"#242b2e\" font-size=\"13\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"52\">01</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"83\">独立井标签</text><rect x=\"192\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f2ece1\"/><text x=\"205\" y=\"52\">02</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"83\">学习类内分布</text><rect x=\"369\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"52\">03</text><text x=\"382\" y=\"83\">三曲线联合分类</text><rect x=\"546\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f2ece1\"/><text x=\"559\" y=\"52\">04</text><text x=\"559\" y=\"83\">混淆矩阵复核</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"145\">训练、输入、输出和验收在演示里逐一可见，真值只用于独立评价。</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a;margin-top:5px\">四步计算链：不同工序承担不同的误差与质控责任。</figcaption></figure><p>测试不使用层界和真实岩性，只读取三条观测曲线。三类分数归一化便于比较，但独立假设和分布偏移会使分数失准，<b>高权重不等于正确概率</b>。单 GR 基线仅能给砂/泥两类，作为解释特征互补的弱基线。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"需要准备什么：数据、标注与独立验证","html":"<p>真实训练标签需来自可靠岩心、岩屑或复核定名，并统一深度与粒度。应按井划分而不是把相邻深度随机拆分；记录井径、流体、仪器与矿物背景，检查类别不均衡。</p><p>演示训练为六井×120 点，测试为独立井 120 点、0.5 m 采样。每次换井改变合成层序与层厚，模型均值、方差和先验保持固定。滑杆模拟观测噪声和 GR 系统偏移，不能模拟全部井间差异。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"DIFFICULTY","title":"难度与参考方向：哪些结论不能越界","html":"<p>简化生成式只包含砂岩、泥岩、灰岩，真实混积岩和复杂流体响应可能超出模型范围。特征之间相关，朴素独立假设不总成立；高准确率只反映本例分布。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-log-interpretation\">SLB：多曲线解释背景</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/naive_bayes.html\">官方：高斯朴素贝叶斯</a>。本例数值为独立合成教学设定，未调用训练好的现场模型。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"岩性识别：从输入到可复核结果","lead":["每一步都对应演示中的输入、固定模型、输出与验收，不以一条平滑曲线替代质控。"],"stats":[["训练与测试","独立井/图"],["交互","换井 / 联动"],["实现","纯前端"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 定名与多曲线深度对齐","role":"数据","do":"以岩心/可靠标签为依据统一 GR、DEN、CNL、采样和类别定义，按井隔离。本例直接生成对齐数据。","effect":"独立训练井与测试井","trap":"标签深度归位和尺度差异可能制造假误差。"},{"name":"02 学习三类响应分布","role":"算法","do":"计算各类均值、方差和先验；小方差设下限，避免个别特征过度支配。","effect":"三类可解释统计模型","trap":"特征独立是假设，不是物理定律。"},{"name":"03 逐点计算类别分数","role":"推理","do":"仅从测试曲线计算各类高斯分数，输出最高类和归一化权重，不读取真实层界。","effect":"砂/泥/灰候选与模型权重","trap":"系统漂移可使模型在高权重下仍误判。"},{"name":"04 按类检查而非只看总分","role":"质控","do":"报告准确率、宏 F1、灰岩召回和混淆矩阵，逐深度核对输入和三类权重。","effect":"错误方向和低分位置","trap":"少数类漏检可能被总体准确率掩盖。"}],"metrics":{"title":"怎么算“做对了”","html":"<figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"四步计算链：不同工序承担不同的误差与质控责任。\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fbfaf6\"/><g fill=\"#242b2e\" font-size=\"13\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"52\">01</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"83\">定名与多曲线深度对</text><rect x=\"192\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f2ece1\"/><text x=\"205\" y=\"52\">02</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"83\">学习三类响应分布</text><rect x=\"369\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"52\">03</text><text x=\"382\" y=\"83\">逐点计算类别分数</text><rect x=\"546\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f2ece1\"/><text x=\"559\" y=\"52\">04</text><text x=\"559\" y=\"83\">按类检查而非只看总</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"145\">训练、输入、输出和验收在演示里逐一可见，真值只用于独立评价。</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a;margin-top:5px\">四步计算链：不同工序承担不同的误差与质控责任。</figcaption></figure><p>准确率之外报告三类宏平均 F1 和灰岩召回，混淆矩阵行是真值、列是预测。归一化模型权重不是已校准正确概率。</p>"},"fails":[{"name":"同响应多解","why":"同岩性不同孔隙/流体可能产生不同曲线。"},{"name":"系统偏移","why":"新井 GR 刻度偏移会破坏训练关系。"},{"name":"类别缺失","why":"只训练三类时不能可靠识别未知或混合岩性。"}]},"demo":{"mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","label":"可运行示范","intro":"GR 提供泥质线索，但低 GR 的砂岩和灰岩仍可能混淆。本例学习 GR、DEN、CNL 的类内响应分布，逐深度输出三类岩性候选。调节噪声与 GR 系统偏移，看模型如何在新井上失准；换井会改变层序与层厚。","height":740}}},config={"mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","label":"可运行示范","intro":"GR 提供泥质线索，但低 GR 的砂岩和灰岩仍可能混淆。本例学习 GR、DEN、CNL 的类内响应分布，逐深度输出三类岩性候选。调节噪声与 GR 系统偏移，看模型如何在新井上失准；换井会改变层序与层厚。","height":740},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":3313,"mime":"text/html","enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>岩性识别 · v2.2 风格</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\" id=\"well-name\">独立合成测试井</span><h1>低 GR 并不只有砂岩：用三条曲线辨别岩性候选</h1><p class=\"lead\">GR 提供泥质线索，但低 GR 的砂岩和灰岩仍可能混淆。本例学习 GR、DEN、CNL 的类内响应分布，逐深度输出三类岩性候选。调节噪声与 GR 系统偏移，看模型如何在新井上失准；换井会改变层序与层厚。</p></div><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"new-well\" type=\"button\">换一口井 ↻</button></div><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label for=\"noise\">观测噪声 <output id=\"out-noise\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.6\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label for=\"param\">GR 系统偏移 / API <output id=\"out-param\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"50\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts\" aria-label=\"输入输出联动图\"><div class=\"legend\"><span style=\"color:#bc9457\">■ 砂岩</span><span style=\"color:#6d8a72\">■ 泥岩</span><span style=\"color:#7395b6\">■ 灰岩</span><span>三行色带：真值 / 模型 / 基线</span></div><svg id=\"input-plot\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"观测输入曲线\"></svg><svg id=\"result-plot\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"模型输出与真值基线\"></svg><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 130\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐深度质控曲线\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\" aria-label=\"指标和逐点解释\"><div class=\"readouts\"><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml0\">三曲线准确率</span><b id=\"m0\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml1\">单 GR 基线</span><b id=\"m1\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml2\">宏平均 F1</span><b id=\"m2\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml3\">灰岩召回</span><b id=\"m3\">—</b></div></div><p id=\"note\" class=\"note\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐深度核对：输入、模型与来源</h2><span id=\"point-depth\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\" for=\"point\">选择深度 <input id=\"point\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"119\" step=\"1\" value=\"62\"></label><div class=\"point-values\" id=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型、训练与验收口径</summary><p class=\"model-copy\">模型从六口独立训练井统计类均值、方差和先验。下表为当前测试井混淆矩阵；单 GR 基线故意保留两类，用于展示灰岩误判。</p><div id=\"coefficients\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"reset\" type=\"button\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"export\" type=\"button\">导出本次 CSV</button><span>同井滑动不随机跳动；换井只更换独立测试资料，训练模型固定。</span></div><p class=\"note\">岩性类别是合成候选，不等于现场定名或地层年代。模型权重不作校准概率解释。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7719,"mime":"text/css","enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.image-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px}.image-pair figure{margin:0;min-width:0}.image-pair figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.image-pair canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:white}#result-plot,#diagnostic{margin-top:8px}.model-copy{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}.model-copy p{line-height:1.8}.demo-results table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.demo-results td,.demo-results th{padding:4px}"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":10069,"mime":"text/javascript","enc":"text","data":"(function(){\nconst SPEC={\"key\":\"lithology\",\"step\":0.5,\"image\":false,\"noise\":0.6,\"value\":0};SPEC.format=p=>p.toFixed(0);\n'use strict';\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),N=120,W=720,L=48,R=14,names=['砂岩','泥岩','灰岩'],colors=['#bc9457','#6d8a72','#7395b6'];\nfunction random(seed){return()=>{seed=(Math.imul(seed,1664525)+1013904223)>>>0;return seed/4294967296}}\nconst clamp=(x,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,x)),average=a=>a.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/a.length;\nfunction solve(a){for(let i=0;i<a.length;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<a.length;j++)if(Math.abs(a[j][i])>Math.abs(a[p][i]))p=j;[a[i],a[p]]=[a[p],a[i]];let d=a[i][i];for(let k=i;k<=a.length;k++)a[i][k]/=d;for(let j=0;j<a.length;j++)if(j!==i){let m=a[j][i];for(let k=i;k<=a.length;k++)a[j][k]-=m*a[i][k]}}return a.map(row=>row[a.length])}\nfunction fit(data){const d=data[0].x.length,means=Array.from({length:d},(_,j)=>average(data.map(v=>v.x[j]))),scales=means.map((m,j)=>Math.sqrt(average(data.map(v=>(v.x[j]-m)**2)))||1),a=Array.from({length:d+1},()=>Array(d+2).fill(0));for(let v of data){let x=[1,...v.x.map((v,j)=>(v-means[j])/scales[j])];for(let i=0;i<=d;i++){for(let j=0;j<=d;j++)a[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];a[i][d+1]+=x[i]*v.y}}for(let j=1;j<=d;j++)a[j][j]+=.05;let weights=solve(a);return{means,scales,weights,predict(x){return weights[0]+x.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+weights[j+1]*(v-means[j])/scales[j],0)}}}\nfunction synth(seed){const r=random(seed),boundaries=[0];while(boundaries.length<6)boundaries.push(boundaries.at(-1)+14+Math.floor(r()*9));boundaries.push(N);let classes=[];for(let k=0;k<6;k++){let c=Math.floor(r()*3);if(k&&c===classes[k-1])c=(c+1)%3;classes.push(c)}let logs=[],labels=[];for(let i=0;i<N;i++){let layer=0;while(layer<5&&i>=boundaries[layer+1])layer++;let k=classes[layer],phi=.08+.12*r(),base=[[40,2.52-phi*.8,.10+phi*.5],[110,2.57,.31],[25,2.77-phi*.5,.07+phi*.25]][k];logs.push(base.map((v,j)=>v+(r()-.5)*[8,.04,.025][j]));labels.push(k)}return{logs,labels,boundaries,noise:Array.from({length:N},()=>[r()+r()-1,r()+r()-1,r()+r()-1]),gapCenter:53+Math.floor(r()*25)}}\nfunction path(arr,lo,hi,top,height){let p='',on=false;for(let i=0;i<arr.length;i++){let v=arr[i];if(v===null||!Number.isFinite(v)){on=false;continue}p+=(on?'L':'M')+xx(i).toFixed(1)+' '+(top+(hi-v)/(hi-lo)*height).toFixed(1);on=true}return p}\nconst xx=i=>L+i/(N-1)*(W-L-R);\nfunction curve(a,lo,hi,top,height,color,dash=''){return '<path d=\"'+path(a,lo,hi,top,height)+'\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"'+color+'\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"'+(dash?' stroke-dasharray=\"'+dash+'\"':'')+'/>'}\nfunction grid(lo,hi,top,height,label){let s='<text x=\"52\" y=\"'+(top-4)+'\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#4d565b\">'+label+'</text>';for(let k=0;k<3;k++){let y=top+height*k/2,v=hi-(hi-lo)*k/2;s+='<line x1=\"48\" y1=\"'+y+'\" x2=\"706\" y2=\"'+y+'\" stroke=\"#efece1\"/><text x=\"43\" y=\"'+(y+3)+'\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\">'+(hi-lo<1?v.toFixed(2):v.toFixed(0))+'</text>'}return s}\nfunction axis(y){let s='';for(let i of [0,30,60,90,119])s+='<text x=\"'+xx(i)+'\" y=\"'+y+'\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">'+(2000+i*SPEC.step).toFixed(2)+'</text>';return s+'<text x=\"706\" y=\"'+(y+13)+'\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\">深度 m →</text>'}\nfunction cursor(height){let i=+$('point').value;return '<line x1=\"'+xx(i)+'\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"'+xx(i)+'\" y2=\"'+height+'\" stroke=\"#9ba3a9\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/>'}\nfunction band(start,end,height){return '<rect x=\"'+xx(start)+'\" y=\"10\" width=\"'+(xx(end)-xx(start))+'\" height=\"'+height+'\" fill=\"#f4f7eb\"/>'}\nfunction setMetrics(values){values.forEach(([label,value],i)=>{$('ml'+i).textContent=label;$('m'+i).textContent=value})}\nfunction values(items,text){$('point-values').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><b>'+b+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=text}\nfunction f1(pred,truth){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;pred.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return {precision:tp/Math.max(1,tp+fp),recall:tp/Math.max(1,tp+fn),f:2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn),tp,fp,fn}}\nfunction table(headers,rows){return '<table><tr>'+headers.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+v+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>'}\nlet wellIndex=0,well=null,result=null,pending=0;const wellName=()=> 'W'+String(wellIndex+1).padStart(3,'0');\nfunction refresh(){const nl=+$('noise').value,p=+$('param').value;$('out-noise').textContent=nl.toFixed(2);$('out-param').textContent=SPEC.format(p);$('well-name').textContent='合成井 '+wellName()+' · 测试种子 '+well.seed;result=compute(well,nl,p);render();inspect();}\nfunction schedule(){if(!pending)pending=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{pending=0;refresh()})}\nfunction flush(){if(pending){cancelAnimationFrame(pending);pending=0}refresh()}\nfunction initialize(){well=makeWell(9107);for(let id of ['noise','param']){$(id).addEventListener('input',schedule);$(id).addEventListener('change',flush)}$('new-well').addEventListener('click',()=>{wellIndex++;well=makeWell(9107+7919*wellIndex);flush()});$('reset').addEventListener('click',()=>{wellIndex=0;well=makeWell(9107);$('noise').value=SPEC.noise;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('point').value=62;flush()});$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{render();inspect()});for(let id of ['input-plot','result-plot','diagnostic']){let e=$(id);if(!e)continue;e.addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=e.getBoundingClientRect(),vx=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*W;$('point').value=Math.round(clamp((vx-L)/(W-L-R)*(N-1),0,N-1));render();inspect()})}if(SPEC.image)for(let id of ['raw-image','mask-image'])$(id).addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$(id).getBoundingClientRect(),vy=(ev.clientY-r.top)/r.height*500;$('point').value=Math.round(clamp((vy-20)/440*(N-1),0,N-1));render();inspect()});$('export').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(pending)flush();let report=csvRows(),quote=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[report.head,...report.rows].map(r=>r.map(quote).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=SPEC.key+'-'+wellName()+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)});refresh()}\n\nconst training=(()=>{let a=[];for(let w=0;w<6;w++){let d=synth(200+w*37);for(let i=0;i<N;i++)a.push({x:d.logs[i],y:d.labels[i]})}return a})();\nconst model=Array.from({length:3},(_,k)=>{let a=training.filter(v=>v.y===k),mean=[0,1,2].map(j=>average(a.map(v=>v.x[j]))),variance=mean.map((m,j)=>Math.max([16,.0001,.0001][j],average(a.map(v=>(v.x[j]-m)**2))));return {mean,variance,prior:a.length/training.length}});\nfunction classify(x){let scores=model.map(m=>Math.log(m.prior)-.5*x.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+Math.log(m.variance[j])+(v-m.mean[j])**2/m.variance[j],0)),mx=Math.max(...scores),weights=scores.map(v=>Math.exp(v-mx)),sum=weights.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0);return {label:scores.indexOf(mx),weights:weights.map(v=>v/sum)}}\nfunction makeWell(seed){return {seed,...synth(seed)}}\nfunction compute(w,nl,shift){let logs=w.logs.map((x,i)=>x.map((v,j)=>v+w.noise[i][j]*nl*[18,.055,.035][j]+(j===0?shift:0))),all=logs.map(classify),pred=all.map(v=>v.label),base=logs.map(v=>v[0]>75?1:0),matrix=Array.from({length:3},()=>[0,0,0]);pred.forEach((v,i)=>matrix[w.labels[i]][v]++);let macro=average(matrix.map((row,k)=>2*row[k]/Math.max(1,row.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)+matrix.reduce((s,v)=>s+v[k],0)))),accuracy=a=>100*a.filter((v,i)=>v===w.labels[i]).length/N;return {logs,all,pred,base,matrix,accuracy:accuracy(pred),baseline:accuracy(base),macro}}\nfunction strips(a,top,label){let s='<text x=\"8\" y=\"'+(top+12)+'\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\">'+label+'</text>';a.forEach((v,i)=>s+='<rect x=\"'+xx(i)+'\" y=\"'+top+'\" width=\"'+((W-L-R)/N+1)+'\" height=\"20\" fill=\"'+colors[v]+'\"/>');return s}\nfunction render(){let d=result,s='';[[0,0,170,18,'GR / API','#41699b'],[1,2.1,2.9,83,'DEN / g·cm⁻³','#9a7656'],[2,0,.5,148,'CNL / v/v','#627b54']].forEach(([j,lo,hi,top,label,color])=>{s+=grid(lo,hi,top,45,label)+curve(d.logs.map(v=>v[j]),lo,hi,top,45,color)});$('input-plot').innerHTML=s+cursor(196)+axis(212);$('result-plot').innerHTML=strips(well.labels,18,'真值')+strips(d.pred,51,'模型')+strips(d.base,84,'基线')+cursor(108)+axis(128);let confusion=table(['真值 / 预测',...names],d.matrix.map((row,k)=>[names[k],...row]));$('coefficients').innerHTML='<p>本次混淆矩阵（行真值、列预测）</p>'+confusion;$('diagnostic').innerHTML=grid(0,1,16,68,'预测最高模型权重（非校准概率）')+curve(d.all.map(v=>Math.max(...v.weights)),0,1,16,68,'#b26a39')+cursor(88)+axis(106);setMetrics([['三曲线准确率',d.accuracy.toFixed(1)+'%'],['单 GR 基线',d.baseline.toFixed(1)+'%'],['宏平均 F1',d.macro.toFixed(3)],['灰岩召回',((d.matrix[2][2]/Math.max(1,d.matrix[2].reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)))*100).toFixed(1)+'%']]);$('note').innerHTML='同样低 GR 的砂岩与灰岩，仍可由密度/中子响应区分。试着增加 <b>GR 系统偏移</b>：同一模型在新井上可能误判；最高权重很高也不代表判断必然正确。';}\nfunction inspect(){let i=+$('point').value,d=result,x=d.logs[i],m=d.all[i];$('point-depth').textContent=(2000+i*.5).toFixed(1)+' m';values([['GR / DEN',x[0].toFixed(1)+' / '+x[1].toFixed(3)],['CNL',x[2].toFixed(3)+' v/v'],['真值 / 预测',names[well.labels[i]]+' / '+names[m.label]],['三类模型权重',m.weights.map(v=>v.toFixed(2)).join(' / ')]],'模型使用各类训练均值、方差和先验计算高斯朴素贝叶斯分数，不读取层界或真值。三类权重顺序为砂岩/泥岩/灰岩；特征独立假设和合成类别可分离性不等于现场成立。该点 '+(m.label===well.labels[i]?'本次合成验收命中。':'本次合成验收误判，应核对岩心与井况。'))}\nfunction csvRows(){return {head:['well_id','seed','depth_m','GR_API','DEN_g_cm3','CNL_vv','truth_class','predicted_class','GR_baseline_class','weight_sand','weight_shale','weight_limestone'],rows:result.logs.map((x,i)=>[wellName(),well.seed,2000+i*.5,...x,well.labels[i],result.pred[i],result.base[i],...result.all[i].weights])}}\ninitialize();\n\n})();"}];c.tabs.demo={label:'可运行示范',mount(root){const host=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo:config},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>host.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"welllog-repair-crosscurve-v22","sceneId":"w5","title":"测井数据修复：跨曲线岭回归 + 校准区间","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-01","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"密度曲线缺失时，连接两端可能把真实层间变化抹平。本例只用仍可用的 GR、CNL 和训练井学习到的关系重建 DEN。拖动缺口长度与噪声，看何时跨曲线模型更好、何时线性插值反而更准。","judge":[{"label":"学习或算法","value":"跨曲线岭回归 + 校准区间","desc":"实际计算并展示模型/证据"},{"label":"训练资料","value":"6 训练井 + 1 校准井","desc":"与当前测试井独立"},{"label":"可视验收","value":"学习修复 MAE","desc":"基线、错误与逐深度核对"},{"label":"难点","value":"中","desc":"真值只用于合成遮挡验收；现场没有全段真值。修复值必须保留来源，本例不修复气层解释或井径扩径等物理异常。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"PROBLEM","title":"当前做法与问题：先理解专业对象","html":"<p>测井缺失段可能来自采集、传输或井眼环境。人工插值能维持连续性，却未必保留地层变化。<b>修复值必须带来源标记</b>，否则后续解释可能把模型输出当成真实测量。</p><figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"图 1 · 连接两端与利用辅助曲线是两种不同的信息来源，不保证后者总更好。\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fbfaf6\"/><g fill=\"#242b2e\" font-size=\"13\"><path d=\"M20 85L85 65L145 70M265 115L330 100L390 105\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#242b2e\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M145 70L265 115\" stroke=\"#41699b\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"148\" y=\"20\" width=\"115\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\" opacity=\".6\"/><text x=\"430\" y=\"50\">两端插值：不知道缺口内部发生什么</text><text x=\"430\" y=\"85\">辅助曲线：提供独立的层间响应线索</text><text x=\"430\" y=\"120\">保留原观测、掩码和插补来源</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a;margin-top:5px\">图 1 · 连接两端与利用辅助曲线是两种不同的信息来源，不保证后者总更好。</figcaption></figure><p>本例只遮掉 DEN，GR 与 CNL 仍然可用。隐去的 DEN 真值单独保留作验收，<b>绝不进入插补输入或缺口两端之外的模型计算</b>。它不解决三条曲线同时缺失或不可修复井况。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"INTERVENTION","title":"算法介入点：输入如何变成候选","html":"<p>用六口独立完整训练井拟合 [GR, CNL, GR×CNL]→DEN 的岭回归，标准化参数只由训练集确定。缺口内用模型前向预测，缺口外保留实测；线性插值基线只读取两端。</p><figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"四步计算链：不同工序承担不同的误差与质控责任。\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fbfaf6\"/><g fill=\"#242b2e\" font-size=\"13\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"52\">01</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"83\">完整训练井</text><rect x=\"192\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f2ece1\"/><text x=\"205\" y=\"52\">02</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"83\">学习跨曲线关系</text><rect x=\"369\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"52\">03</text><text x=\"382\" y=\"83\">仅缺口插补</text><rect x=\"546\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f2ece1\"/><text x=\"559\" y=\"52\">04</text><text x=\"559\" y=\"83\">掩码段误差与来源</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"145\">训练、输入、输出和验收在演示里逐一可见，真值只用于独立评价。</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a;margin-top:5px\">四步计算链：不同工序承担不同的误差与质控责任。</figcaption></figure><p>另用独立校准井的残差构造 90% 教学预测区间，显示实际覆盖率。观测噪声、输入偏移和缺口分布会破坏覆盖前提；区间不是每个个体的保证。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"需要准备什么：数据、标注与独立验证","html":"<p>真实资料需原始曲线、缺失/异常掩码、井径与维护记录，以及辅助曲线质量。先明确“缺失原因是否允许插补”，再按井隔离训练、校准和测试；标准化不能访问测试真值。</p><p>本例训练 720 点、校准井 120 点、独立测试井 120 点。缺口长 5–60 点，0.5 m/点；换井改变层序与缺口中心。CSV 对缺口 DEN 留空，保留 masked 与 source 字段，便于下游追溯。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"DIFFICULTY","title":"难度与参考方向：哪些结论不能越界","html":"<p>同层短缺口适合插值，复杂层段则可能从辅助曲线受益；模型不保证总胜出。真实缺失无真值时，应通过完整井段遮挡实验、独立井验证和下游物理一致性复核，不以曲线“平滑”代替精度。</p><p><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/impute.html\">官方：模型插补与缺失数据</a>；<a href=\"https://www.slb.com/resource-library/oilfield-review/defining-series/defining-log-interpretation\">SLB：测井物理响应与解释背景</a>。演示不是掩码自编码器或现场解释软件。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"测井数据修复：从输入到可复核结果","lead":["每一步都对应演示中的输入、固定模型、输出与验收，不以一条平滑曲线替代质控。"],"stats":[["训练与测试","独立井/图"],["交互","换井 / 联动"],["实现","纯前端"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 保留原始值与缺失掩码","role":"数据","do":"明确遮挡起止、曲线单位和仍可用数据；原始 DEN 缺口为 null，真值在单独验收数组。","effect":"可追踪的观测与掩码","trap":"不能先填真值再假装模型修复。"},{"name":"02 从独立完整井学习","role":"算法","do":"仅在训练井上拟合标准化回归，独立校准井估计残差分位数。","effect":"固定映射与校准半宽","trap":"校准井不是训练井，更不能拿测试误差调区间。"},{"name":"03 只在缺口内插补","role":"推理","do":"从 GR、CNL 及交互项预测 DEN；缺口外保留观测。并行计算仅使用缺口两端的线性基线。","effect":"预测曲线与 observed/imputed 来源","trap":"辅助曲线异常时，跨曲线模型同样可能失效。"},{"name":"04 只在遮挡段验收","role":"质控","do":"比较两种方法 MAE、缺口长度和区间实际覆盖率，逐点显示输入与来源，导出 CSV。","effect":"公平的掩码段评价","trap":"把缺口外样本混入指标会虚高修复效果。"}],"metrics":{"title":"怎么算“做对了”","html":"<figure style=\"margin:14px 0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"四步计算链：不同工序承担不同的误差与质控责任。\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"165\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#fbfaf6\"/><g fill=\"#242b2e\" font-size=\"13\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"52\">01</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"83\">保留原始值与缺失掩</text><rect x=\"192\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f2ece1\"/><text x=\"205\" y=\"52\">02</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"83\">从独立完整井学习</text><rect x=\"369\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"52\">03</text><text x=\"382\" y=\"83\">只在缺口内插补</text><rect x=\"546\" y=\"25\" width=\"158\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f2ece1\"/><text x=\"559\" y=\"52\">04</text><text x=\"559\" y=\"83\">只在遮挡段验收</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"145\">训练、输入、输出和验收在演示里逐一可见，真值只用于独立评价。</text></g></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:11px;color:#79828a;margin-top:5px\">四步计算链：不同工序承担不同的误差与质控责任。</figcaption></figure><p>MAE 与区间覆盖率仅在被遮挡段统计，单位 g/cm³。插值和回归使用同一缺口；校准半宽来自独立井，不能用测试误差回调。</p>"},"fails":[{"name":"辅助曲线也损坏","why":"模型失去有效输入，不能继续盲补。"},{"name":"过度平滑","why":"两端插值可能抹掉层间突变。"},{"name":"区间失准","why":"测试噪声或地层差异可能降低校准区间覆盖。"}]},"demo":{"mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","label":"可运行示范","intro":"密度曲线缺失时，连接两端可能把真实层间变化抹平。本例只用仍可用的 GR、CNL 和训练井学习到的关系重建 DEN。拖动缺口长度与噪声，看何时跨曲线模型更好、何时线性插值反而更准。","height":740}}},config={"mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","label":"可运行示范","intro":"密度曲线缺失时，连接两端可能把真实层间变化抹平。本例只用仍可用的 GR、CNL 和训练井学习到的关系重建 DEN。拖动缺口长度与噪声，看何时跨曲线模型更好、何时线性插值反而更准。","height":740},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":3366,"mime":"text/html","enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>测井数据修复 · v2.2 风格</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\" id=\"well-name\">独立合成测试井</span><h1>缺口里没有答案：用仍可用的曲线补全密度响应</h1><p class=\"lead\">密度曲线缺失时，连接两端可能把真实层间变化抹平。本例只用仍可用的 GR、CNL 和训练井学习到的关系重建 DEN。拖动缺口长度与噪声，看何时跨曲线模型更好、何时线性插值反而更准。</p></div><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"new-well\" type=\"button\">换一口井 ↻</button></div><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label for=\"noise\">观测噪声 <output id=\"out-noise\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.6\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label for=\"param\">连续缺失长度 / 点 <output id=\"out-param\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" type=\"range\" min=\"5\" max=\"60\" step=\"1\" value=\"30\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts\" aria-label=\"输入输出联动图\"><div class=\"legend\"><span class=\"dot truth\">合成真值</span><span class=\"dot model\">跨曲线修复</span><span class=\"dot base\">线性插值</span><span class=\"mud\">浅色：被遮挡 DEN</span></div><svg id=\"input-plot\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 230\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"观测输入曲线\"></svg><svg id=\"result-plot\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"模型输出与真值基线\"></svg><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 130\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐深度质控曲线\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\" aria-label=\"指标和逐点解释\"><div class=\"readouts\"><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml0\">学习修复 MAE</span><b id=\"m0\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml1\">插值基线 MAE</span><b id=\"m1\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml2\">缺口长度</span><b id=\"m2\">—</b></div><div class=\"ro\"><span class=\"k\" id=\"ml3\">90%区间实际覆盖</span><b id=\"m3\">—</b></div></div><p id=\"note\" class=\"note\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐深度核对：输入、模型与来源</h2><span id=\"point-depth\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\" for=\"point\">选择深度 <input id=\"point\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"119\" step=\"1\" value=\"62\"></label><div class=\"point-values\" id=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型、训练与验收口径</summary><p class=\"model-copy\">训练、校准、测试按井独立。区间半宽仅由校准井残差确定，下表显示实际系数与覆盖口径。展开说明查看插补来源和真实缺失限制。</p><div id=\"coefficients\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"reset\" type=\"button\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"export\" type=\"button\">导出本次 CSV</button><span>同井滑动不随机跳动；换井只更换独立测试资料，训练模型固定。</span></div><p class=\"note\">真值只用于合成遮挡验收；现场没有全段真值。修复值必须保留来源，本例不修复气层解释或井径扩径等物理异常。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7719,"mime":"text/css","enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.image-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px}.image-pair figure{margin:0;min-width:0}.image-pair figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.image-pair canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:white}#result-plot,#diagnostic{margin-top:8px}.model-copy{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}.model-copy p{line-height:1.8}.demo-results table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.demo-results td,.demo-results th{padding:4px}"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":10708,"mime":"text/javascript","enc":"text","data":"(function(){\nconst SPEC={\"key\":\"repair\",\"step\":0.5,\"image\":false,\"noise\":0.6,\"value\":30};SPEC.format=p=>p.toFixed(0);\n'use strict';\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),N=120,W=720,L=48,R=14,names=['砂岩','泥岩','灰岩'],colors=['#bc9457','#6d8a72','#7395b6'];\nfunction random(seed){return()=>{seed=(Math.imul(seed,1664525)+1013904223)>>>0;return seed/4294967296}}\nconst clamp=(x,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,x)),average=a=>a.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)/a.length;\nfunction solve(a){for(let i=0;i<a.length;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<a.length;j++)if(Math.abs(a[j][i])>Math.abs(a[p][i]))p=j;[a[i],a[p]]=[a[p],a[i]];let d=a[i][i];for(let k=i;k<=a.length;k++)a[i][k]/=d;for(let j=0;j<a.length;j++)if(j!==i){let m=a[j][i];for(let k=i;k<=a.length;k++)a[j][k]-=m*a[i][k]}}return a.map(row=>row[a.length])}\nfunction fit(data){const d=data[0].x.length,means=Array.from({length:d},(_,j)=>average(data.map(v=>v.x[j]))),scales=means.map((m,j)=>Math.sqrt(average(data.map(v=>(v.x[j]-m)**2)))||1),a=Array.from({length:d+1},()=>Array(d+2).fill(0));for(let v of data){let x=[1,...v.x.map((v,j)=>(v-means[j])/scales[j])];for(let i=0;i<=d;i++){for(let j=0;j<=d;j++)a[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];a[i][d+1]+=x[i]*v.y}}for(let j=1;j<=d;j++)a[j][j]+=.05;let weights=solve(a);return{means,scales,weights,predict(x){return weights[0]+x.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+weights[j+1]*(v-means[j])/scales[j],0)}}}\nfunction synth(seed){const r=random(seed),boundaries=[0];while(boundaries.length<6)boundaries.push(boundaries.at(-1)+14+Math.floor(r()*9));boundaries.push(N);let classes=[];for(let k=0;k<6;k++){let c=Math.floor(r()*3);if(k&&c===classes[k-1])c=(c+1)%3;classes.push(c)}let logs=[],labels=[];for(let i=0;i<N;i++){let layer=0;while(layer<5&&i>=boundaries[layer+1])layer++;let k=classes[layer],phi=.08+.12*r(),base=[[40,2.52-phi*.8,.10+phi*.5],[110,2.57,.31],[25,2.77-phi*.5,.07+phi*.25]][k];logs.push(base.map((v,j)=>v+(r()-.5)*[8,.04,.025][j]));labels.push(k)}return{logs,labels,boundaries,noise:Array.from({length:N},()=>[r()+r()-1,r()+r()-1,r()+r()-1]),gapCenter:53+Math.floor(r()*25)}}\nfunction path(arr,lo,hi,top,height){let p='',on=false;for(let i=0;i<arr.length;i++){let v=arr[i];if(v===null||!Number.isFinite(v)){on=false;continue}p+=(on?'L':'M')+xx(i).toFixed(1)+' '+(top+(hi-v)/(hi-lo)*height).toFixed(1);on=true}return p}\nconst xx=i=>L+i/(N-1)*(W-L-R);\nfunction curve(a,lo,hi,top,height,color,dash=''){return '<path d=\"'+path(a,lo,hi,top,height)+'\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"'+color+'\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"'+(dash?' stroke-dasharray=\"'+dash+'\"':'')+'/>'}\nfunction grid(lo,hi,top,height,label){let s='<text x=\"52\" y=\"'+(top-4)+'\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#4d565b\">'+label+'</text>';for(let k=0;k<3;k++){let y=top+height*k/2,v=hi-(hi-lo)*k/2;s+='<line x1=\"48\" y1=\"'+y+'\" x2=\"706\" y2=\"'+y+'\" stroke=\"#efece1\"/><text x=\"43\" y=\"'+(y+3)+'\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\">'+(hi-lo<1?v.toFixed(2):v.toFixed(0))+'</text>'}return s}\nfunction axis(y){let s='';for(let i of [0,30,60,90,119])s+='<text x=\"'+xx(i)+'\" y=\"'+y+'\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">'+(2000+i*SPEC.step).toFixed(2)+'</text>';return s+'<text x=\"706\" y=\"'+(y+13)+'\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\">深度 m →</text>'}\nfunction cursor(height){let i=+$('point').value;return '<line x1=\"'+xx(i)+'\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"'+xx(i)+'\" y2=\"'+height+'\" stroke=\"#9ba3a9\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/>'}\nfunction band(start,end,height){return '<rect x=\"'+xx(start)+'\" y=\"10\" width=\"'+(xx(end)-xx(start))+'\" height=\"'+height+'\" fill=\"#f4f7eb\"/>'}\nfunction setMetrics(values){values.forEach(([label,value],i)=>{$('ml'+i).textContent=label;$('m'+i).textContent=value})}\nfunction values(items,text){$('point-values').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><b>'+b+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=text}\nfunction f1(pred,truth){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;pred.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return {precision:tp/Math.max(1,tp+fp),recall:tp/Math.max(1,tp+fn),f:2*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn),tp,fp,fn}}\nfunction table(headers,rows){return '<table><tr>'+headers.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+v+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>'}\nlet wellIndex=0,well=null,result=null,pending=0;const wellName=()=> 'W'+String(wellIndex+1).padStart(3,'0');\nfunction refresh(){const nl=+$('noise').value,p=+$('param').value;$('out-noise').textContent=nl.toFixed(2);$('out-param').textContent=SPEC.format(p);$('well-name').textContent='合成井 '+wellName()+' · 测试种子 '+well.seed;result=compute(well,nl,p);render();inspect();}\nfunction schedule(){if(!pending)pending=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{pending=0;refresh()})}\nfunction flush(){if(pending){cancelAnimationFrame(pending);pending=0}refresh()}\nfunction initialize(){well=makeWell(9107);for(let id of ['noise','param']){$(id).addEventListener('input',schedule);$(id).addEventListener('change',flush)}$('new-well').addEventListener('click',()=>{wellIndex++;well=makeWell(9107+7919*wellIndex);flush()});$('reset').addEventListener('click',()=>{wellIndex=0;well=makeWell(9107);$('noise').value=SPEC.noise;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('point').value=62;flush()});$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{render();inspect()});for(let id of ['input-plot','result-plot','diagnostic']){let e=$(id);if(!e)continue;e.addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=e.getBoundingClientRect(),vx=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*W;$('point').value=Math.round(clamp((vx-L)/(W-L-R)*(N-1),0,N-1));render();inspect()})}if(SPEC.image)for(let id of ['raw-image','mask-image'])$(id).addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$(id).getBoundingClientRect(),vy=(ev.clientY-r.top)/r.height*500;$('point').value=Math.round(clamp((vy-20)/440*(N-1),0,N-1));render();inspect()});$('export').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(pending)flush();let report=csvRows(),quote=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[report.head,...report.rows].map(r=>r.map(quote).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=SPEC.key+'-'+wellName()+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)});refresh()}\n\nconst feature=x=>[x[0],x[2],x[0]*x[2]];\nconst training=(()=>{let a=[];for(let w=0;w<6;w++){let d=synth(200+w*37);for(let i=0;i<N;i++)a.push({x:feature(d.logs[i]),y:d.logs[i][1]})}return a})();\nconst model=fit(training),calibration=(()=>{let d=synth(7013);return d.logs.map(x=>Math.abs(model.predict(feature(x))-x[1])).sort((a,b)=>a-b)})(),radius=calibration[Math.ceil((calibration.length+1)*.9)-1];\nfunction makeWell(seed){return {seed,...synth(seed)}}\nfunction compute(w,nl,length){let start=clamp(Math.round(w.gapCenter-length/2),1,N-length-2),end=start+length,mask=Array.from({length:N},(_,i)=>i>=start&&i<end),inputs=w.logs.map((x,i)=>x.map((v,j)=>v+w.noise[i][j]*nl*[12,.012,.025][j])),observed=inputs.map((x,i)=>mask[i]?null:x[1]),pred=inputs.map((x,i)=>mask[i]?model.predict(feature(x)):observed[i]),baseline=observed.map((v,i)=>mask[i]?observed[start-1]+(observed[end]-observed[start-1])*(i-start+1)/(end-start+1):v),trueDEN=w.logs.map(x=>x[1]),mae=a=>average(a.filter((_,i)=>mask[i]).map((v,j)=>Math.abs(v-trueDEN[start+j]))),hit=mask.filter((v,i)=>v&&Math.abs(pred[i]-trueDEN[i])<=radius).length;return {start,end,mask,inputs,observed,pred,baseline,trueDEN,mae:mae(pred),maeBase:mae(baseline),coverage:hit/length*100}}\nfunction render(){let d=result,s=band(d.start,d.end,196);[[0,0,170,18,'仍可用 GR / API','#41699b'],[2,0,.5,83,'仍可用 CNL / v/v','#627b54']].forEach(([j,lo,hi,top,label,color])=>s+=grid(lo,hi,top,45,label)+curve(d.inputs.map(v=>v[j]),lo,hi,top,45,color));s+=grid(2.1,2.9,148,45,'原始 DEN：浅色窗口内已遮挡 / g·cm⁻³')+curve(d.observed,2.1,2.9,148,45,'#242b2e');$('input-plot').innerHTML=s+cursor(196)+axis(212);\nlet p=band(d.start,d.end,130)+grid(2.1,2.9,18,110,'DEN / g·cm⁻³');p+=curve(d.trueDEN,2.1,2.9,18,110,'#2f7d6b','5 3')+curve(d.pred,2.1,2.9,18,110,'#b26a39')+curve(d.baseline,2.1,2.9,18,110,'#41699b');$('result-plot').innerHTML=p+cursor(132)+axis(150);$('diagnostic').innerHTML=band(d.start,d.end,80)+grid(-.35,.35,16,64,'仅缺口误差 / g·cm⁻³（外部不评价）')+curve(d.pred.map((v,i)=>d.mask[i]?v-d.trueDEN[i]:null),-.35,.35,16,64,'#b26a39')+curve(d.baseline.map((v,i)=>d.mask[i]?v-d.trueDEN[i]:null),-.35,.35,16,64,'#41699b')+cursor(85)+axis(105);\nsetMetrics([['学习修复 MAE',d.mae.toFixed(3)+' g/cm³'],['插值基线 MAE',d.maeBase.toFixed(3)+' g/cm³'],['缺口长度',(d.end-d.start)*.5+' m'],['90%区间实际覆盖',d.coverage.toFixed(0)+'%']]);$('note').innerHTML=d.mae<d.maeBase?'缺口跨越岩性变化时，仅连两端可能抹平层间差异；本次<b>辅助曲线修复误差较小</b>。改变缺口长度或换井，比较是否仍成立。':'本次<b>线性插值比学习模型更准确</b>。同层短缺口本来就适合插值，跨曲线回归并非总能胜出。不要把平滑程度当作正确性。';$('coefficients').innerHTML='<p>独立校准井提供 120 个绝对残差，取 90% 有限样本分位数，半宽 '+radius.toFixed(4)+' g/cm³。本例仅报告缺口段覆盖率，输入噪声和分布改变可能破坏覆盖。</p>'+table(['标准化特征','训练均值','尺度','系数'],['GR','CNL','GR×CNL'].map((v,j)=>[v,model.means[j].toFixed(4),model.scales[j].toFixed(4),model.weights[j+1].toFixed(5)]));}\nfunction inspect(){let i=+$('point').value,d=result,x=d.inputs[i];$('point-depth').textContent=(2000+i*.5).toFixed(1)+' m';values([['观测 DEN',d.mask[i]?'缺失（null）':d.observed[i].toFixed(3)],['GR / CNL',x[0].toFixed(1)+' / '+x[2].toFixed(3)],['预测 / 真值',d.pred[i].toFixed(3)+' / '+d.trueDEN[i].toFixed(3)],['来源标记',d.mask[i]?'学习插补':'保留观测']],d.mask[i]?'该点的真实 DEN 未进入模型。只用仍可用的 GR、CNL 和交互项计算插补；线性插值只读缺口两端。校准区间为 ['+(d.pred[i]-radius).toFixed(3)+', '+(d.pred[i]+radius).toFixed(3)+'] g/cm³，真值只用于教学验收，不能当作现场已知答案。':'缺口外保留原始观测，不用拟合值覆盖实测。本次误差统计仅覆盖浅色遮挡段，不把未修复样本混进指标。')}\nfunction csvRows(){let d=result;return {head:['well_id','seed','depth_m','GR_API','CNL_vv','observed_DEN_g_cm3','masked','source','true_DEN_g_cm3','reconstructed_DEN_g_cm3','linear_DEN_g_cm3','lower_if_imputed','upper_if_imputed'],rows:d.inputs.map((x,i)=>[wellName(),well.seed,2000+i*.5,x[0],x[2],d.observed[i]??'',+d.mask[i],d.mask[i]?'imputed':'observed',d.trueDEN[i],d.pred[i],d.baseline[i],d.mask[i]?d.pred[i]-radius:'',d.mask[i]?d.pred[i]+radius:''])}}\ninitialize();\n\n})();"}];c.tabs.demo={label:'可运行示范',mount(root){const host=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo:config},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>host.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}